    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/1e60ff97e4a7511481ed1044ebcf210a.avif?t=1748827086\" width=630 height=354 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Faded World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a village where people have lost their colors and can no longer possess them, &quot;Fade&quot; is born with the unique ability to hold color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soul Wonder is a pixel-art, retro-style 2D action roguelike game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features side-scrolling gameplay where players must dodge various enemy attacks and utilize powerful weapons to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/fe79cd46f307eb1a51451c17a0b956f5.avif?t=1748827086\" width=630 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/9934a29930d2f3bb01e494967cfe2953.avif?t=1748827086\" width=630 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/349e45a149c509d8b65a8f484e91b79d.avif?t=1748827086\" width=630 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/bda499cff1d2009066a017ca2884f305.avif?t=1748827086\" width=630 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/9b68dac1e079507749576b9fb806147e.avif?t=1748827086\" width=630 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Weapons and Playstyles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start by choosing 2 out of 5 different weapons to build your own unique playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon has 4 different &quot;Weapon Form Enhancements&quot; that transform both basic attacks and skills when upgraded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, &quot;Weapon Stat Enhancements&quot; allow you to strengthen your weapons further, making battles more favorable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/37014c502476fe067b63896fe47005f9.avif?t=1748827086\" width=630 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/10238f897473e21053b8b6050ae48324.poster.avif?t=1748827086\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/10238f897473e21053b8b6050ae48324.webm?t=1748827086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/10238f897473e21053b8b6050ae48324.mp4?t=1748827086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Themes and Enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 5 unique themes, including snowy fields, forests, oceans, deserts, and castles, each with a distinctive atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 types of regular enemies, 10 elite enemies, and formidable bosses await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the ruthless foes in this faded world and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/d52aab3e940dccb47a4f353112ba8a84.poster.avif?t=1748827086\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/d52aab3e940dccb47a4f353112ba8a84.webm?t=1748827086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/d52aab3e940dccb47a4f353112ba8a84.mp4?t=1748827086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/76d0e90ed8e870e73a408e7b42771b72.avif?t=1748827086\" width=630 height=354 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/7b7c52ca38c5488d155996e3cca2dd5f.avif?t=1748827086\" width=630 height=354 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless Threats</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you stay in a stage, the more unpredictable threats\u2014such as black owls and lightning\u2014will appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive as long as possible, gather upgrade materials, and move on to the next stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ultimate Challenge</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you manage to progress through all the stages, a powerful boss will appear at the end of each chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test the strength you've built up so far, defeat the boss, and claim ultimate victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/3729b07b781dd16485c690b7668a1c8f.poster.avif?t=1748827086\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/3729b07b781dd16485c690b7668a1c8f.webm?t=1748827086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/3729b07b781dd16485c690b7668a1c8f.mp4?t=1748827086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/18d955e6e06a8b3d069e2464b27807d4.avif?t=1748827086\" width=630 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planned Features After the Beta Version</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Upgrade System</strong><br>All weapons will receive at least one enhancement option to diversify gameplay and customization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded Farming Mechanics</strong><br>Players will be able to obtain accessories and other items by defeating monsters, enhancing the loot farming experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Monsters</strong><br>Each chapter will introduce a unique boss monster, with a total of five new bosses planned. Defeating all of them will unlock the final boss challenge.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/1e60ff97e4a7511481ed1044ebcf210a.avif?t=1748827086\" width=630 height=354 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Faded World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a village where people have lost their colors and can no longer possess them, &quot;Fade&quot; is born with the unique ability to hold color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soul Wonder is a pixel-art, retro-style 2D action roguelike game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features side-scrolling gameplay where players must dodge various enemy attacks and utilize powerful weapons to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/fe79cd46f307eb1a51451c17a0b956f5.avif?t=1748827086\" width=630 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/9934a29930d2f3bb01e494967cfe2953.avif?t=1748827086\" width=630 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/349e45a149c509d8b65a8f484e91b79d.avif?t=1748827086\" width=630 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/bda499cff1d2009066a017ca2884f305.avif?t=1748827086\" width=630 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/9b68dac1e079507749576b9fb806147e.avif?t=1748827086\" width=630 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Weapons and Playstyles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start by choosing 2 out of 5 different weapons to build your own unique playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon has 4 different &quot;Weapon Form Enhancements&quot; that transform both basic attacks and skills when upgraded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, &quot;Weapon Stat Enhancements&quot; allow you to strengthen your weapons further, making battles more favorable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/37014c502476fe067b63896fe47005f9.avif?t=1748827086\" width=630 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/10238f897473e21053b8b6050ae48324.poster.avif?t=1748827086\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/10238f897473e21053b8b6050ae48324.webm?t=1748827086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/10238f897473e21053b8b6050ae48324.mp4?t=1748827086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Themes and Enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 5 unique themes, including snowy fields, forests, oceans, deserts, and castles, each with a distinctive atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 types of regular enemies, 10 elite enemies, and formidable bosses await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the ruthless foes in this faded world and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/d52aab3e940dccb47a4f353112ba8a84.poster.avif?t=1748827086\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/d52aab3e940dccb47a4f353112ba8a84.webm?t=1748827086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/d52aab3e940dccb47a4f353112ba8a84.mp4?t=1748827086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/76d0e90ed8e870e73a408e7b42771b72.avif?t=1748827086\" width=630 height=354 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/7b7c52ca38c5488d155996e3cca2dd5f.avif?t=1748827086\" width=630 height=354 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless Threats</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you stay in a stage, the more unpredictable threats\u2014such as black owls and lightning\u2014will appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive as long as possible, gather upgrade materials, and move on to the next stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ultimate Challenge</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you manage to progress through all the stages, a powerful boss will appear at the end of each chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test the strength you've built up so far, defeat the boss, and claim ultimate victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/3729b07b781dd16485c690b7668a1c8f.poster.avif?t=1748827086\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/3729b07b781dd16485c690b7668a1c8f.webm?t=1748827086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/3729b07b781dd16485c690b7668a1c8f.mp4?t=1748827086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/18d955e6e06a8b3d069e2464b27807d4.avif?t=1748827086\" width=630 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planned Features After the Beta Version</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Upgrade System</strong><br>All weapons will receive at least one enhancement option to diversify gameplay and customization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded Farming Mechanics</strong><br>Players will be able to obtain accessories and other items by defeating monsters, enhancing the loot farming experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Monsters</strong><br>Each chapter will introduce a unique boss monster, with a total of five new bosses planned. Defeating all of them will unlock the final boss challenge.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Soul Wander is a moving journey to restore lost colors and light to a dark world. Can you find the light in this darkness? Each region has its own story. Grow stronger with weapons and soul powers. Your choices shape the world\u2019s fate. Begin your quest to reclaim lost colors now!",
